            "size": 5050,
            "text": "{\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://v3b.fal.media/files/b/0aad24c6/uASnzMo3lh1Mr5N77uAvu_minimax-h3.mp4\",\"content_type\":\"video/mp4\",\"file_name\":\"uASnzMo3lh1Mr5N77uAvu_minimax-h3.mp4\",\"file_size\":2835893,\"width\":832,\"height\":480,\"fps\":24.0,\"duration\":12.541666666666666,\"num_frames\":301},\"seed\":1198401229,\"width\":832,\"height\":480,\"frame_count\":301,\"duration\":12.541666666666666,\"start_time\":1.625,\"resume_time\":2.125,\"injected_duration\":5.0,\"expanded_prompt\":\"subject_definitions:\\n<Audio 1> is the audio reference for the source clip, featuring quiet ambient room tone and subtle soft rustling movement friction.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[video continuation + audio reference] The target video continues the low-angle tracking shot of the runner sprinting along the reddish athletic track, as a red panda sitting near the track border waves once and holds still while the runner powers forward into the return frame composition.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Audio 1>: reference - preserves the subtle ambient presence and soft movement friction without adding dialogue or musical score.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\n[Shot 1] One continuous shot extends the source video's final shot through the continuation, with no cuts or shot changes. The camera continues in a single, unbroken low-angle tracking shot moving forward at a fast, steady speed alongside the sprinting runner on the reddish synthetic athletic track under harsh, direct sunlight. Picking up seamlessly from the runner's mid-stride suspension, the runner's left running shoe makes crisp, elastic contact with the textured rubber surface, propelling the body forward as the right leg drives through into the subsequent stride. Crisp, deep black shadows cast by the runner's muscular legs and dark running shoes ripple across the lane surface and painted white boundary lines to the left. As the camera tracks continuously forward alongside the lane curve, a small red panda with rich russet-red fur, dark limbs, and a bushy ringed tail is positioned calmly on the ground near the track's inner boundary. As the runner's legs surge forward into view, the red panda sits upright on its haunches, smoothly raises its right front paw in a single, clear waving gesture toward the runner, and then immediately lowers its paw to settle into a completely still, alert posture with upright ears. The red panda holds entirely motionless on the apron, watching steadily as the runner maintains a relentless athletic tempo. The camera remains locked at ground level, capturing the fluid mechanics of the sprinting legs—alternating footfalls, calf muscle tension, and the dark silhouette dancing over the sunlit red rubber. Sinking into the steady pace over the five-second span, the runner executes rhythmic, driving steps across the lane markers. The camera glides forward with smooth momentum, keeping the runner's lower body centered and aligning precisely with the return framing: the left running shoe descends toward the red surface just prior to ground contact, the right leg folds sharply upward behind in mid-flight recovery, and the crisp diagonal shadow stretches across the lane.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nAn open-air athletic track soundscape layered over the baseline tone of <Audio 1>, featuring rhythmic, rubbery shoe impacts snapping against the synthetic track surface, faint rushing wind friction from forward running speed, and a tiny rustle of movement as the red panda shifts to wave.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nN/A\",\"source\":{\"width\":1280,\"height\":720,\"fps\":24.0,\"duration\":8.08,\"frame_count\":193,\"has_audio\":true},\"timings\":{\"download\":2.277553601190448,\"probe\":0.366323463851586,\"text_encoding\":0.08990314695984125,\"condition_encoding\":6.20400533080101e-05,\"text_tokens\":582.0,\"reference_tokens\":130.0,\"denoising\":1.4643772130366415,\"int8_fp8_calls\":0.0,\"_tail_started\":1279268.018523058,\"audio_vae_decode\":0.09284040005877614,\"video_vae